    "description": "The Telecom SIM Swap API facilitates the seamless exchange of SIM cards for telecommunication services. This operation enables service providers and users to swap SIM cards linked to their accounts, ensuring uninterrupted service during transitions. Typical consumers include telecom operators and customer support systems that manage subscriber accounts. By leveraging this API, system integrators can efficiently handle user requests for SIM changes while maintaining account integrity and service continuity.",
